{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":599879,\"title\":\"7 1/2 Women\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A man is haunted successively by seven women who have lost their keys. He reacts to the request that he be allowed to use the toilet with increasing helplessness and despair, which is discharged in violence.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jAn7FqEfdpNmEmu7IQxhugPGHi3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":2,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":8,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bidzina Kanchaveli\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2422931,\"name\":\"Bidzina Kanchaveli\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3616990,\"name\":\"Caroline Castner\",\"character\":\"Tänzerin\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3616991,\"name\":\"Marie-Ulrike Garg\",\"character\":\"Fürsorgliche Frau\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1670431,\"name\":\"Anne von Keller\",\"character\":\"Hektische Frau\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9RxNNp4v2sZFOAIjYeqnKbZrErl.jpg\"},{\"id\":3616993,\"name\":\"Anna Noack\",\"character\":\"Frau\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2694892,\"name\":\"Francesca Strauss\",\"character\":\"Lächelnde Frau\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":43935,\"title\":\"Dylan Dog: Dead of Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZdYn5IktnGVg7pRA2JHD1rdZDH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbxu6J4qZ69JWNKITrHiR60IXx8.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9707,\"title\":\"Bubba Ho-tep\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pKQBit5ZV7GEOTiMBSYC6xBn86K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TpUjiwMYtASIJYbtuyPkCe4kKw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The \\\"true\\\" story of what really became of Elvis Presley. We find Elvis as an elderly resident in an East Texas rest home, who switched identities with an Elvis impersonator years before his \\\"death,\\\" then missed his chance to switch back. He must team up with JFK and fight an ancient Egyptian mummy for the souls of their fellow residents.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8933,\"title\":\"O'Horten\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bOTDPnPVykfS2WprAJc5mkq5ltu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xAbJd9OnuGODnO0iiO9whdAcmpp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odd Horton is dependable and contained: he's a train driver retiring after 40 years of service, living a simple life. His idea of adventure is to fly from one city in Norway to another. Starting on the night of his retirement dinner, Odd has a series of dislocating experiences: a boy insists that Odd sit by his bedside while he falls asleep; misadventure causes Odd to miss his last run; he witnesses an arrest; he assists an old man and makes a friend; he takes a trip with a blindfolded driver; he adopts a dog; he takes stock late one night at the roundhouse; he revisits his mother's disappointment in him. How should he live the rest of his life?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":818,\"title\":\"Austin Powers in Goldmember\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n8V61f1v7idya4WJzGEJNoIp9iL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kuPpElzfYnzsCye0hF8EbJSrvwo.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The world's most shagadelic spy continues his fight against Dr. Evil. This time, the diabolical doctor and his clone, Mini-Me, team up with a new foe—'70s kingpin Goldmember. While pursuing the team of villains to stop them from world domination, Austin gets help from his dad and an old girlfriend.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645426,\"title\":\"Exit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ciFrVinZnfFSflqLnXPTChqFwVI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4oT6oUknrfEOEiHigPoejONHa88.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Events take a sinister turn one night in London, when two very different couples arrive at a double-booked apartment. Actions have consequences and not all debts are paid for with money. Leaving, it's harder than you think.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1438792,\"title\":\"Impressions\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/caaMMs36D4fuXX4qnivkI4Arl7O.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chad and Colin are newly engaged. Colin -while telling their engagement story- does an impression of Chad that boils his blood. A night of revelations ensue as the two discover the truth of their relationship, and each other.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1630309,\"title\":\"Last Images Of Our Childhood Memories\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/doEw2LfCH6G44CTX6VHMQ9JeoU7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Vi4qFEBfQV74HuCzXbtT8k8j6w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman struggles to find balance in her own relationship with nostalgia while unravelling the fate of a childhood friend who vanished after becoming consumed by it.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"e67Qtn_3hkc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KPOuJGkpblk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"eTIBCR-ToVk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url"